    "homepage": "https://github.com/shariqh/agent-inbox",
    "section": "utils",
    "priority": "optional",
    "shortDescription": "Local, cross-project attention inbox for coding agents",
    "longDescription": "Agent Inbox is a local command center for questions, plans, and live status from coding agents. It gives GitHub Copilot CLI and Claude Code one shared place to surface decisions, handoffs, notes, milestones, and multi-step plans, backed by a single local SQLite database with no model calls, hosted service, or telemetry."
  },
